S('customs-clearance-india','Customs Clearance in India: Import and Export | YAM Logistics',
 'Customs clearance in India by a licensed customs broker, R-7/92. 14 stations: Nhava Sheva, Mundra, Delhi, Mumbai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai and more. Duty estimate in 2 hours.',
 'Customs clearance in India','CUSTOMS CLEARANCE · INDIA','Customs clearance in India,','without the guesswork.',
 'Customs clearance in India means filing a bill of entry (imports) or a shipping bill (exports) on ICEGATE, paying duty, and getting the out of charge or let export order. YAM Logistics does it as a licensed customs broker with licence R-7/92.',
 [('Where we clear',[('table',['Type','Stations'],[['Sea ports','Nhava Sheva, Mundra'],['Inland depots','ICD Tughlakabad, ICD Dadri'],['Air cargo','Delhi IGI, Mumbai Sahar (24x7 desk), Navi Mumbai, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai, Ahmedabad, Lucknow, Kochi, Kozhikode']],'')]),
  ('How import clearance works',['Get an IEC, classify the goods, check the policy and any licence.','The line or airline files the manifest. We file the bill of entry, usually in advance.','You self-assess the duty; customs may pass the bill, query it or examine the cargo.','Pay the duty, receive the out of charge order and move the cargo.','Full steps: <a href="guides/customs-clearance-process-india" style="color:#0A6CC2">customs clearance process in India</a> and <a href="guides/how-to-import-into-india-step-by-step" style="color:#0A6CC2">how to import step by step</a>.']),
  ('How export clearance works',['File the shipping bill, present the cargo, get the let export order, and gate-in. Then claim drawback and RoDTEP where eligible. See the export guides in our <a href="guides/" style="color:#0A6CC2">guides hub</a>.']),
  ('Tools that save time',['<a href="customs-duty-calculator" style="color:#0A6CC2">Customs duty calculator</a> and <a href="import-duty/" style="color:#0A6CC2">import duty by HS code</a> for a first estimate.','<a href="landed-cost-calculator" style="color:#0A6CC2">Landed cost calculator</a> for the full cost of an import.','<a href="document-checker" style="color:#0A6CC2">Document checker</a> to catch mismatches before they cause delays.'])],
 [('What is customs clearance?','It is the process of declaring goods to Customs, paying any duty and getting permission to bring them into the country or send them out.'),
  ('How long does customs clearance take in India?','A clean bill of entry with no examination can clear in a day or two. Examination, queries or missing certificates add days.'),
  ('Can I clear customs without a broker?','An importer or exporter can file their own, but most use a licensed customs broker for speed and accuracy.'),
  ('Which documents do I need?','Commercial invoice, packing list, bill of lading or airway bill, IEC, and any licence or certificate for the product. See the import documents checklist in the guides.')],
 [('customs-brokerage','Customs brokerage','Our full service.'),('customs-clearance-delhi','Delhi clearance','IGI and the Delhi depots.'),('guides/bill-of-entry-explained','Bill of entry explained','What it is and how to file it.')])

S('sea-freight-services-india','Sea Freight Services India: FCL and LCL | YAM Logistics',
 'Sea freight from and to India: FCL, LCL, project and break-bulk. Nhava Sheva, Mundra and Delhi ICDs, with our own customs clearance. Free container load planner.',
 'Sea freight services India','SEA FREIGHT · INDIA','Sea freight services from','and to India.',
 'We book full container (FCL) and part container (LCL) shipments through Nhava Sheva and Mundra, with rail to Delhi NCR depots. Because we hold a customs broker licence, clearance is part of the same job.',
 [('FCL and LCL',[('table',['','FCL','LCL'],[['Cargo','One shipper fills the container','Shared with other shippers'],['Best when','Larger volumes','Small or irregular volumes'],['Port handling','Container handled whole','Stuffed and deconsolidated at a CFS']],'The break-even depends on rates and the lane; we will quote both.')]),
  ('Plan before you book',['Use the <a href="container-load-planner" style="color:#0A6CC2">free 3D container load planner</a> to see what fits in a 20 or 40 foot container.','Check <a href="guides/air-freight-vs-sea-freight" style="color:#0A6CC2">air vs sea</a> if transit time matters.','Read the <a href="guides/mundra-vs-jnpt-which-port" style="color:#0A6CC2">Mundra vs JNPT</a> guide to choose the port.']),
  ('What is included',['Booking, documentation, bill of lading and port handling.','Customs clearance at origin or destination.','Rail or road to inland depots and door delivery.','Insurance if you want it, and a 24x7 desk for tracking.'])],
 [('How long does sea freight take from India?','Roughly a week to the Gulf, three to five weeks to Europe and longer to the Americas, depending on the service and any transshipment.'),
  ('When is LCL better than FCL?','LCL suits small volumes. Past a certain volume FCL is cheaper per cubic metre and safer, so we quote both.'),
  ('Do you handle project cargo?','Yes. Oversized and break-bulk cargo is handled with a separate plan for lifting, lashing and permits.')],
 [('ocean-freight','Ocean freight','Our full sea service.'),('container-load-planner','Container load planner','Free 3D planner.'),('guides/icd-vs-cfs-vs-port-explained','ICD vs CFS vs port','Where to clear.')])

S('air-freight-services-india','Air Freight Services India: Import and Export | YAM Logistics',
 'Air freight from and to India: Mumbai, Delhi, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai, Ahmedabad. DG, AOG and charters. 24x7 desk at Sahar Air Cargo. Licensed customs broker.',
 'Air freight services India','AIR FREIGHT · INDIA','Air freight services from','and to India.',
 'We book air cargo from and to Indian airports with a 24x7 desk at Sahar Air Cargo in Mumbai and a customs licence of our own, so the flight and the clearance run as one job.',
 [('Airports we serve',['Mumbai (Sahar, 24x7 desk), Delhi IGI, Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Chennai, Ahmedabad, Lucknow, Kochi and Kozhikode.']),
  ('What we move',['General cargo, perishables and temperature-sensitive goods.','Dangerous goods, packed and declared to IATA rules.','Urgent aircraft parts (AOG) and charters for oversize or time-critical loads.','Mobile phones and electronics exports under our dedicated programme.']),
  ('Know the cost',['Chargeable weight decides price. Read <a href="guides/air-freight-chargeable-weight-and-rates" style="color:#0A6CC2">how air freight rates work</a> and the <a href="guides/volumetric-weight-air-freight" style="color:#0A6CC2">volumetric weight</a> guide, or compare with <a href="guides/express-courier-vs-air-freight" style="color:#0A6CC2">express courier</a>.']),
  ('Track it',['Follow any flight with the <a href="tracking/" style="color:#0A6CC2">free AWB tracking pages</a> and the <a href="air-cargo-status-codes" style="color:#0A6CC2">status codes guide</a>. Print compliant labels with the <a href="awb-label-generator" style="color:#0A6CC2">AWB label generator</a>.'])],
 [('How long does air freight take from India?','Often one to five days door to door depending on lane, cut-off times and clearance.'),
  ('Do you handle dangerous goods by air?','Yes, when the cargo is classified, packed and declared correctly. We check before the cargo reaches the airline.'),
  ('Can I book only the clearance?','Yes. You can use your own forwarder and use us for customs clearance at the India end.')],
 [('air-freight','Air freight','Our full air service.'),('air-cargo-clearance-delhi-igi','Delhi air cargo clearance','IGI Airport.'),('guides/air-freight-booking-steps','Book air freight','Step by step.')])
